- op: discuss  # 3cce
  at: '2026-10-18T00:10:19Z'  # 3cce
  by: agent  # 3cce
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3cce
  clock: 3  # 3cce
  nonce: 3cce  # 3cce
  message: "Done in PR #1702 (dev ac651f01d5) as one family: zig, llvm_ir and cobol take the CALLER by position (symbol_declared_by / symbols_at); tlaplus, agda and cobol bind a referenced TARGET in the same file (or program) before the repo-wide resolver; each of the five analyzers gained a two-file same-name fixture. INV-musij, INV-nafij, INV-razus, INV-lutaj closed with it. NOT done, deliberately: (1) the proposed regex gate on resolver.lookup(<caller-ish name>) — on dev it matches 13 sites of which 11 are legitimate CALLEE lookups (glsl, r_lang, dart, wgsl, wolfram, csharp, lua, perl, js_ts, c, elixir), so it would be a baseline of waivers rather than a gate; (2) the shared two-file fixture 'every analyzer runs' needs a per-language snippet for each of ~60 analyzers — split out as its own item (see the WI filed right after this note). The structural guard stays the position-keyed helper, now used by 32 analyzers."  # 3cce
